# Aria of Sorrow: power-on, through the opening (Mina's talk), then walk right through the first rooms; the map (CVA-1) grows on the bottom screen.
# SELECT (the profile's open key) shows the game's own map on the game screen for comparison.
wait 240
mash START 4 40
mash A 10 40
wait 300
press START 6
wait 60
press A 6
wait 60
mash A 60 40
wait 200
mash A 60 40
wait 200
mash A 100 30
wait 200
shot a-room
hold RIGHT 200
mash A 60 30
hold RIGHT 300
shot x0
mash A 20 30
hold RIGHT 300
wait 30
shot w1
press SELECT 6
wait 150
shot m1
press SELECT 6
wait 60
mash A 20 30
hold RIGHT 300
wait 30
shot w2
press SELECT 6
wait 150
shot m2
press SELECT 6
wait 60
mash A 20 30
hold RIGHT 300
wait 30
shot w3
press SELECT 6
wait 150
shot m3
press SELECT 6
wait 60
mash A 20 30
hold RIGHT 300
wait 30
shot w4
press SELECT 6
wait 150
shot m4
press SELECT 6
